{
  "about": "NIP-17 kind 15 encrypted file vectors for Nostr Vault (build plan D0, RESEARCH/NV_SYNC_REWORK_BUILD_PLAN_2026_11_12.md). The source of truth is docs/DM_FILE_VECTORS.json; the copies in the Apple, Android and web test folders must stay byte-identical to it.",
  "spec": "https://github.com/nostr-protocol/nips/blob/master/17.md (kind 15)",
  "rules": [
    "Algorithm: AES-256-GCM, 128-bit tag appended to the ciphertext (ciphertext_hex = ciphertext || tag). No AAD.",
    "decryption-key: 64 lowercase hex chars (32 bytes). decryption-nonce: lowercase hex, any non-empty length; 12 and 16 bytes both appear in the wild.",
    "x = sha256 of the encrypted bytes (what the server holds). ox = sha256 of the original file. size = encrypted bytes.",
    "Receive order: algorithm is aes-gcm, then sha256(download) == x, then decrypt (tag must verify), then sha256(plaintext) == ox, then show as file-type.",
    "content is the file URL; the vectors use files.example and made-up keys. Every key, nonce and pubkey is sha256 of a label, or a sha256 prefix: none is real."
  ],
  "expect_values": {
    "ok": "decrypts to plaintext_hex",
    "reject_x": "refuse: sha256(ciphertext) != x",
    "reject_decrypt": "refuse: GCM tag does not verify",
    "reject_ox": "refuse: sha256(plaintext) != ox",
    "reject_algorithm": "refuse: algorithm is not aes-gcm",
    "reject_key": "refuse: key is not 32 bytes"
  },
  "labels": {
    "sender": "sha256(\"d0 sender\")",
    "receiver": "sha256(\"d0 receiver\")",
    "png-12-byte-nonce": "key sha256(\"d0 key 1\"), nonce first 12 bytes of sha256(\"d0 nonce 12\")",
    "png-16-byte-nonce": "key sha256(\"d0 key 2\"), nonce first 16 bytes of sha256(\"d0 nonce 16\")",
    "amethyst-crypto-kmp": "key sha256(\"d0 amethyst key\"), nonce first 16 bytes of sha256(\"d0 amethyst nonce\")"
  },
